Package: solakonone
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jan Timm <jhktimm@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libfmt9
Description: Solakon ONE Solar Monitor
 Real-time Modbus-TCP monitor for Solakon ONE hybrid solar inverters.
 Displays voltage, current, power, battery status, and energy
 statistics from connected meters and BMS systems.
